{"scenario":"permission-last-answer","description":"Two turns, each ended cancelled by the agent with no session/cancel. Prompt 1: the client must answer perm-1 reject-always, then perm-2 allow-once. Prompt 2: perm-3 allow-once, then perm-4 reject-always","on_stdin_close":"exit"}
{"include":"handshake.jsonl"}
{"expect":{"method":"session/prompt","as":"p1","params":{"sessionId":"sess-1"}}}
